stem/uploads/fae/image/asset/2130/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2130/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2130/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2130/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2130/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2130/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Hims___Hers.jpg","Hims & Hers is a fast-growing company that thinks and acts differently. Their multi-specialty telehealth platform connects consumers with licensed healthcare professionals directly, providing greater accessibility and giving users greater control over their own healthcare. By challenging stigmas around physical and mental health conditions and opening up access to safe, quality healthcare, they are reimagining primary care in a rapidly changing world. Intentional about building a public-ready company from the beginning, the team at Hims & Hers has also defied stereotypes about how start-ups should grow and set themselves up for long-term success—we’re just proud to be on this journey that’s sure to last long into the future!","Hims & Hers is a telehealth platform that connects consumers with healthcare professionals directly, giving users greater control over their own health.","Hims & Hers - IVP Portfolio - Fast-Growing Health Tech Companies","Hims & Hers - IVP Portfolio ","A direct-to-consumer wellness company, Hims & Hers connects consumers to licensed healthcare professionals, connecting people to high-quality medical care for numerous conditions related to primary care, mental health, sexual health, skincare, and more. The platform also offers thoughtfully created and curated health and wellness products.","A multi-specialty telehealth platform building a virtual front door for easy, convenient access to high-quality healthcare",{"id":33,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"323","2018-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=19375&v=41","Andrew Dudum","/content/hims-hers-reimagining-healthcare-and-a-new-model-for-startup-growth/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/hims-&-hers/",{"id":41,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":42,"assetUrlXs":43,"assetUrlSm":44,"assetUrlMd":45,"assetUrlLg":46,"assetUrlXl":47,"assetUrlXxl":48},"325","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/xs_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/sm_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/md_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/lg_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/xl_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/325/xxl_Hims___Hers.jpg","Founded 2017\r\nPartnered 2018\r\nIPO 2021","Hims & Hers ","hims-hers",{"id":53,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"322",{"name":55,"slug":56},"Public","public",[58,61,64],{"fullName":59,"slug":60},"Alex Lim","alex-lim",{"fullName":62,"slug":63},"Jules Maltz","jules-maltz",{"fullName":65,"slug":66},"Eric Liaw","eric-liaw",{"id":68,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":69,"assetUrlXs":70,"assetUrlSm":71,"assetUrlMd":72,"assetUrlLg":73,"assetUrlXl":74,"assetUrlXxl":75},"324","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/324/Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/324/xs_Hims___Hers.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/324/sm_Hims___Hers.jpg","